# L §4.2 day_of(m, n) is "day n of month m"; n = 0 is outside its domain, known only at the key: RUN-DOMAIN
# (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input n0: int
def c[m in months]: date = day_of(m, n0) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  n0 = 0

ask q: c[2026-03] law 2026-06-30
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-DOMAIN ...
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
